{"study_accession":"PRJNA602668","secondary_study_accession":"SRP243900","title":"Oncogene-induced senescence in hematopoietic progenitors features myeloid restricted hematopoiesis, chronic inflammation and histiocytosis","description":"We generated a humanized mouse model of oncogene-induced senescence in hematopoietic stem and progenitor cells by expressing the activated oncogene BRAF-V600E. Mice succumbed to bone marrow failure and multi-organ dissemination of aberrant macrophages and dendritic cells. We observed a myeloid-restricted hematopoiesis,and uncovered the activation of a senescence program, characterized by growth arrest and senescence-associated secretory phenotype (SASP), which involved also non-mutated bystander cells. Overall design: We sequenced the mRNA of FACS-sorted human CD45+CD33+ cells from the bone marrow of NSG mice transplanted with CD34+ cells transduced with lentiviral vectors expressing BRAF-V600E and GFP, wtBRAF and GFP, GFP alone and mock control","pubmed":"34315896","geo_series":"","n_samples":22,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN13901078","study_accession":"PRJNA602668","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"Sample 23: wtBRAF - GFP+ rep3","description":"Sample 23: wtBRAF - GFP+ rep3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4278926","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":4,"first_public":"2021-05-15","attributes":[["source_name","Myeloid cells from bone marrow of NSG mice"],["tissue","Myeloid cells from bone marrow"],["cell_type","CD45+CD33+"],["lentiviral vector","wtBRAF"],["transduction status","yes"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR10950879","experiment_accession":"SRX7617853","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":4308196,"base_count":327422896,"first_public":"2021-05-15","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM4278926: Sample 23: wtBRAF - GFP+ rep3 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR10950880","experiment_accession":"SRX7617853","library_layout":"SINGL